---
const vector = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}figures/method-overview.svg`;
---

<figure class="paper-figure method-figure">
  <img
    src={vector}
    alt="ParetoSaddler's five-stage loop: repeated execution, statistical Pareto promotion, development evaluation and retention, continued optimization, and final deployment selection."
    width="1200"
    height="627"
    loading="lazy"
  />
  <figcaption>
    <strong>The ParetoSaddler loop.</strong> Local evidence determines promotion;
    the development-evaluated candidate pool and its Pareto archive support further
    optimization. The deployment preference governs the final selection. Original
    vector Figure 2 from the paper.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
